        "answer": {
          "short": "$x<1$ or $2<x<3$.\n\nRead where the blue curve is above the red line; exclude the intersections and the pole.",
          "worked": "The blue curve is above the red line to the left of $x=1$ and between $x=2$ and the asymptote $x=3$.\n\nThe strict inequality excludes $x=1,2$, and $f$ is undefined at $x=3$.\n\nTherefore $x<1$ or $2<x<3$.",
