        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$1<x<2$ or $x>3$.\n\nRead where the blue curve is below the red line; exclude the intersections and the pole.",
          "worked": "The blue curve is below the red line between $x=1$ and $x=2$, and to the right of the asymptote $x=3$.\n\nThe strict inequality excludes $x=1,2$, and $f$ is undefined at $x=3$.\n\nTherefore $1<x<2$ or $x>3$.",
